1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,068
This club turns away

2
00:00:01,149 --> 00:00:02,380
most people who can pay.

3
00:00:02,891 --> 00:00:03,843
Getting in starts with

4
00:00:03,889 --> 00:00:05,062
an initiation fee of

5
00:00:05,108 --> 00:00:06,293
fifty thousand dollars.

6
00:00:06,676 --> 00:00:07,721
Then come annual dues

7
00:00:07,767 --> 00:00:08,963
of another twenty thousand,

8
00:00:09,172 --> 00:00:10,205
whether you ever visit

9
00:00:10,252 --> 00:00:10,774
or not.

10
00:00:11,099 --> 00:00:11,889
The dining room and

11
00:00:11,923 --> 00:00:12,887
the bar still lose

12
00:00:12,945 --> 00:00:13,955
money on almost every

13
00:00:14,013 --> 00:00:14,686
meal served.

14
00:00:15,070 --> 00:00:15,720
So the money was

15
00:00:15,778 --> 00:00:16,695
never really paying for

16
00:00:16,730 --> 00:00:18,297
the food, or the room.

17
00:00:18,622 --> 00:00:19,655
It pays a committee

18
00:00:19,679 --> 00:00:20,758
whose entire job is

19
00:00:20,805 --> 00:00:22,326
deciding who does not belong.

20
00:00:22,929 --> 00:00:24,114
Membership works less like

21
00:00:24,137 --> 00:00:25,472
a purchase and more

22
00:00:25,507 --> 00:00:26,447
like a background check

23
00:00:26,482 --> 00:00:27,469
with a price attached.

24
00:00:27,852 --> 00:00:29,477
The fee was never admission.

25
00:00:29,651 --> 00:00:30,394
It is the club

26
00:00:30,487 --> 00:00:31,219
paying to keep the

27
00:00:31,253 --> 00:00:32,414
wrong people out.
